  title: Agniya's Ember
  description: The flame does not go out when the god falls. It just stops pretending to be a god and remembers being fire - patient, indifferent, older than the seven, older than the war that made them seven. Somewhere in the heat you were sure you heard it say your true name before it forgot how.
